==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|lang=la|cortex||bark}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|es|cortices}}

# {{context|countable|anatomy|lang=en}} The outer layer of an internal organ or body structure, such as the [[kidney]] or the [[brain]].
# {{context|uncountable|botany|lang=en}} The [[tissue]] of a [[stem]] or [[root]] that lies inward from the [[epidermis]], but exterior to the [[vascular]] tissue.

